==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|de}} {{term|Marzipan|lang=de}}, earlier {{term|marcipan|lang=de}}, a misinterpretation of {{etyl|it}} {{term|marzapane|lang=it}} (as if from Latin {{term|Marci|lang=la}} {{term|panis|lang=la}} "Mark's bread"), now thought originally to come from {{w|Mottama|Martaban}} ({{Mymr|[[မုတ္ထမ]]}}), a Burmese port known for its spice exports.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[confection]] of [[almond]] [[paste]], [[sugar]] and [[egg white]].

